01:14:50,945 --> 01:14:53,608
Nothing , nothing good can come

573
01:14:53,642 --> 01:14:55,268
from reading this nonsense .

574
01:14:56,859 --> 01:14:58,380
Look what happened to Emma , she took

575
01:14:58,416 --> 01:15:01,010
her own life , for Christ 's sake !

576
01:15:01,044 --> 01:15:03,050
I 'm not so sure she did .

577
01:15:08,791 --> 01:15:10,209
No , Lizzy .

578
01:15:15,501 --> 01:15:17,507
You really shouldn 't be out after dark .

579
01:15:17,542 --> 01:15:19,998
Y - - you don 't know what 's out there .

580
01:15:20,032 --> 01:15:23,007
There is nothing out there !

581
01:15:24,459 --> 01:15:26,672
Oh , God . Isaac , please !

582
01:15:26,707 --> 01:15:27,917
Where 's your gun , Lizzy ?

583
01:15:27,953 --> 01:15:29,888
[ eerie music ]

584
01:15:33,971 --> 01:15:35,906
[ explosion ]

585
01:15:42,998 --> 01:15:44,623
[ clattering ]

586
01:15:45,729 --> 01:15:47,217
[ groans ]

587
01:15:56,140 --> 01:15:57,696
[ screams ]

588
01:16:00,049 --> 01:16:02,020
[ music continues ]

589
01:16:02,055 --> 01:16:03,990
[ indistinct whispering ]

590
01:16:08,833 --> 01:16:10,770
[ screams ]

591
01:16:12,569 --> 01:16:13,848
[ clatters ]

592
01:16:15,854 --> 01:16:18,794
[ groans ]

593
01:16:26,299 --> 01:16:28,340
[ screams ]

594
01:16:28,374 --> 01:16:30,311
[ breathing heavily ]

595
01:16:32,145 --> 01:16:34,081
[ music continues ]

596
01:16:43,972 --> 01:16:46,912
[ indistinct whispering ]

597
01:16:56,942 --> 01:16:59,882
[ Emma humming ]

598
01:17:10,674 --> 01:17:12,195
[ humming continues ]

599
01:17:22,502 --> 01:17:24,023
[ humming continues ]

600
01:17:50,067 --> 01:17:51,590
Isaac .

601
01:17:56,016 --> 01:17:57,815
How long have you had this ?

602
01:18:05,908 --> 01:18:07,845
It 's not safe here .

603
01:18:14,242 --> 01:18:15,696
Isaac .

604
01:18:19,708 --> 01:18:22,025
Isaac , we have to leave .

605
01:18:22,059 --> 01:18:23,824
We have to get out .

606
01:18:25,726 --> 01:18:28,493
How did she get your gun , Lizzy ?

607
01:18:30,118 --> 01:18:32,193
It doesn 't matter .

608
01:18:32,227 --> 01:18:35,167
- Emma ? - Lizzy !

609
01:18:35,202 --> 01:18:36,482
[ laughing ]

610
01:18:37,969 --> 01:18:40,390
Isaac , I don 't care what happened .

611
01:18:40,425 --> 01:18:42,396
[ instrumental music ]

612
01:18:42,431 --> 01:18:44,402
- We need to go home . - I told Gideon .

613
01:18:44,437 --> 01:18:46,269
I told Gideon that he should leave

614
01:18:46,304 --> 01:18:48,241
and that he shouldn 't come back .

615
01:18:49,556 --> 01:18:51,181
What did you do ?

616
01:18:51,215 --> 01:18:55,158
Isaac ... please untie me .

617
01:18:55,193 --> 01:18:58,444
You don 't understand what 's happening ..

618
01:18:58,479 --> 01:19:00,659
... but I do , I 've seen it .

619
01:19:00,693 --> 01:19:02,629
[ Emma laughing ]

620
01:19:02,665 --> 01:19:05,361
Isaac ! Please untie me !

621
01:19:05,396 --> 01:19:09,097
- She was pregnant . - Oh , God , no .

622
01:19:09,131 --> 01:19:13,420
It 's just gonna be me , you , Isaac ..

623
01:19:14,146 --> 01:19:15,356
[ thunder rumbling ]

624
01:19:15,391 --> 01:19:18,193
- You killed her . - No . It wasn 't me .

625
01:19:18,227 --> 01:19:19,646
It was .

626
01:19:21,029 --> 01:19:23,969
[ dramatic music ]

627
01:19:42,473 --> 01:19:45,412
[ growling ]

628
01:19:48,386 --> 01:19:49,666
Isaac .

629
01:19:53,091 --> 01:19:54,509
There 's something here .

630
01:19:59,247 --> 01:20:00,388
[ laughing ]

631
01:20:00,422 --> 01:20:01,564
Lizzy !

632
01:20:02,914 --> 01:20:05,854
[ music continues ]

633
01:20:07,340 --> 01:20:09,139
It 's right there .

634
01:20:09,173 --> 01:20:11,007
There is nothing !

635
01:20:11,041 --> 01:20:12,182
Lizzy .

636
01:20:12,217 --> 01:20:13,254
[ gunshot ]

637
01:20:14,777 --> 01:20:15,918
No .

638
01:20:16,852 --> 01:20:17,959
[ grunts ]

639
01:20:34,110 --> 01:20:36,047
[ instrumental music ]

640
01:20:40,820 --> 01:20:42,757
[ breathing heavily ]

641
01:21:06,206 --> 01:21:08,143
[ music continues ]

642
01:21:38,302 --> 01:21:40,239
[ music continues ]

643
01:21:46,154 --> 01:21:47,779
Good morning .

644
01:21:47,814 --> 01:21:49,646
Morning , reverend .

645
01:21:49,680 --> 01:21:51,100
How was your journey ?

646
01:21:52,517 --> 01:21:54,281
Fine . Thank you .

647
01:21:55,146 --> 01:21:57,463
I have something for you .

648
01:21:57,497 --> 01:21:59,124
I came prepared .

649
01:22:00,506 --> 01:22:02,825
You can never be too prepared .

650
01:22:04,104 --> 01:22:07,009
The Lord 's blessing be with you .

651
01:22:07,044 --> 01:22:08,565
And with you .

652
01:22:10,467 --> 01:22:12,404
[ music continues ]

653
01:22:22,089 --> 01:22:24,026
[ instrumental music ]

654
01:22:25,202 --> 01:22:27,000
There 's something out there .

655
01:22:30,700 --> 01:22:32,775
There is nothing out there .

656
01:22:34,401 --> 01:22:37,030
This land , there 's something wrong with it .

657
01:22:39,244 --> 01:22:42,529
Your mind is looking for things to worry about .

658
01:22:44,466 --> 01:22:46,057
First baby and all .

659
01:22:54,185 --> 01:22:56,295
[ music continues ]

660
01:22:56,329 --> 01:22:58,266
It 's just you and me .

661
01:23:08,192 --> 01:23:11,132
